  "theorem_statement": "The three PMNS lepton-mixing angles all admit W(3,3) closed forms with numerator and denominator small W(3,3) integers: sin^2 theta_12 = mu/Phi_3 = 4/13, sin^2 theta_23 = mu/Phi_6 = 4/7, sin^2 theta_13 = q^2/(lam*Phi_4)^2 = 9/400.  All three predictions land within 1 sigma of NuFit 5.2 NH best-fit values.",
